// 单线程、有限并发的门步进程池。依赖完成后可运行；独占任务等待队列空出。日志持续落盘，完成结果交回编排层。
import { join, nat } from "./build_lib";

export struct GateTask {
    name: string,
    exe: string,
    args: List<string>,
    cwd: string,
    deps: List<string>,
    exclusive: bool,
}

export struct GateResult {
    code: int,
    log: Bytes,
    elapsedMs: int,
}

struct Live {
    idx: int,
    h: int,
    log: Bytes,
    outOpen: bool,
    errOpen: bool,
    ended: bool,
    code: int,
    started: int,
    endedAt: int,
    timedOut: bool,
    flushedAt: int,
    flushedLen: int,
}

struct Started {
    h: int,
    error: string,
}

function start(task: GateTask): Ref<Started> {
    const h = procSpawn(task.exe, task.args, task.cwd, 0) catch (e) {
        return new Started { h: -1, error: e.message };
    };
    return new Started { h: h, error: "" };
}

function emptyTask(): GateTask {
    return GateTask { name: "", exe: "", args: listNew(), cwd: "", deps: listNew(), exclusive: false };
}

function emptyLive(): Ref<Live> {
    return new Live { idx: -1, h: 0, log: bytesNew(0), outOpen: false, errOpen: false, ended: true, code: 1, started: 0,
        endedAt: 0, timedOut: false, flushedAt: 0, flushedLen: 0 };
}

function flush(path: string, log: Bytes): void {
    writeFileBytes(nat(path), log) catch (e) {};
}

function ready(task: GateTask, completed: Map<string, int>): bool {
    for (name in task.deps) {
        if (!mapHas(completed, name)) { return false; }
    }
    return true;
}

// done 在本线程中同步调用，可以更新父层的报告。completed 是已有的前置结果（例如普通产物报告）。
export function gatePool(tasks: List<GateTask>, width: int, work: string, initial: List<string>, limitNs: int, drainNs: int,
    done: (string, Ref<GateResult>) => void): void {
    const completed: Map<string, int> = mapNew();
    for (name in initial) { mapSet(completed, name, 1); }
    const state: List<int> = listNew();
    for (task in tasks) { listPush(state, 0); }
    const active: List<Ref<Live>> = listNew();
    const buf = bytesNew(65536);
    let left = listLen(tasks);
    while (left > 0) {
        while (listLen(active) < width) {
            let next = -1;
            let k = 0;
            while (k < listLen(tasks)) {
                const task = listGet(tasks, k) catch emptyTask();
                if ((listGet(state, k) catch 2) == 0 && ready(task, completed)) { next = k; break; }
                k = k + 1;
            }
            if (next < 0) { break; }
            const task = listGet(tasks, next) catch emptyTask();
            const first = listGet(active, 0);
            if (first != None) {
                const running = listGet(tasks, (first ?? emptyLive()).idx) catch emptyTask();
                if (running.exclusive || task.exclusive) { break; }
            }
            const started = monoNs();
            print("START " + task.name);
            listSet(state, next, 1);
            const child = start(task);
            if (child.h < 0) {
                const log = bytesFromStr("起不了 " + task.exe + "：" + child.error + "\n");
                flush(join(work, task.name + ".log"), log);
                done(task.name, new GateResult { code: 1, log: log, elapsedMs: (monoNs() - started) / 1000000 });
                mapSet(completed, task.name, 1);
                listSet(state, next, 2);
                left = left - 1;
                continue;
            }
            listPush(active, new Live { idx: next, h: child.h, log: bytesNew(0), outOpen: true, errOpen: true, ended: false, code: 0,
                    started: started, endedAt: 0, timedOut: false, flushedAt: started, flushedLen: 0 });
            if (task.exclusive) { break; }
        }
        if (listLen(active) == 0 && left > 0) {
            // 无法满足的依赖是编排错误，不能把未执行的任务算成通过。
            let k = 0;
            while (k < listLen(tasks)) {
                if ((listGet(state, k) catch 2) == 0) {
                    const task = listGet(tasks, k) catch emptyTask();
                    const log = bytesFromStr("门步依赖无法满足：" + task.name + "\n");
                    flush(join(work, task.name + ".log"), log);
                    done(task.name, new GateResult { code: 1, log: log, elapsedMs: 0 });
                    listSet(state, k, 2);
                    left = left - 1;
                }
                k = k + 1;
            }
            continue;
        }
        let progressed = false;
        let k = 0;
        while (k < listLen(active)) {
            const s = listGet(active, k) catch emptyLive();
            const task = listGet(tasks, s.idx) catch emptyTask();
            if (s.outOpen) {
                const n = procRead(s.h, 1, buf);
                if (n < 0) { s.outOpen = false; }
                else if (n > 0) { bytesAppend(s.log, bytesSlice(buf, 0, n)); progressed = true; }
            }
            if (s.errOpen) {
                const n = procRead(s.h, 2, buf);
                if (n < 0) { s.errOpen = false; }
                else if (n > 0) { bytesAppend(s.log, bytesSlice(buf, 0, n)); progressed = true; }
            }
            if (!s.ended) {
                const code = procWait(s.h, 0);
                if (code != None) { s.code = code ?? 1; s.ended = true; s.endedAt = monoNs(); progressed = true; }
            }
            const now = monoNs();
            if (!s.ended && !s.timedOut && now - s.started >= limitNs) { s.timedOut = true; procKill(s.h); }
            const path = join(work, task.name + ".log");
            const size = bytesLen(s.log);
            if (size != s.flushedLen && now - s.flushedAt >= 2000000000 + size / 1048576 * 1000000000) {
                flush(path, s.log); s.flushedLen = size; s.flushedAt = now;
            }
            if (s.ended && ((!s.outOpen && !s.errOpen) || now - s.endedAt >= drainNs)) {
                procClose(s.h);
                if (s.timedOut) {
                    bytesAppend(s.log, bytesFromStr("超时：" + toStr(limitNs / 1000000000) + " 秒后结束了子进程\n"));
                    s.code = 1;
                }
                if (s.outOpen || s.errOpen) { bytesAppend(s.log, bytesFromStr("子进程已退出，后代进程仍占着输出管道；停止读取\n")); }
                flush(path, s.log);
                done(task.name, new GateResult { code: s.code, log: s.log, elapsedMs: (monoNs() - s.started) / 1000000 });
                mapSet(completed, task.name, 1);
                listSet(state, s.idx, 2);
                left = left - 1;
                listRemoveAt(active, k);
                progressed = true;
                continue;
            }
            k = k + 1;
        }
        if (!progressed && listLen(active) > 0) {
            const first = listGet(active, 0) catch emptyLive();
            if (first.outOpen || first.errOpen) { const waited = ioWait(first.h, 6, 5); }
            else { const waited = procWait(first.h, 5); }
        }
    }
}
